<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 22-DEC.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 22-DEC.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Fern situated at 9.2 north, 140 East, in the Philippine Sea is a threat to shipping. It is expected to track northwestward and slowly intensify through Wednesday. Winds are now 45 knots gusting to 55 knots but are expected to increase to 65 knots by Wednesday.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS  </p>
